 interior de la habitación se escucha un disparo, por lo que Federico y Nicolás corren en busca de Fernanda, quien yace muerta en su cama." type="episode" contentRating="NONADULT" duration="3062000" grandparentArt="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1766822-landscape.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/67e89124191c82b2c18c3e63" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/67e89124191c82b2c18c3e63" grandparentRatingKey="67e89124191c82b2c18c3e63" grandparentThumb="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1920/2/1766822-portrait.jpg" grandparentTitle="353" grandparentType="show" index="129" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/1/1766821-thumb.jpg" title="La Trepadora - S01:E129" userState="0"><Image alt="La Trepadora - S01:E129" type="coverArt" url="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1766822-landscape.jpg"/><Image alt="La Trepadora - S01:E129" type="coverPoster" url="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1920/2/1766822-portrait.jpg"/><Image alt="La Trepadora - S01:E129" type="snapshot" url="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/1/1766821-thumb.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" id="6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" ratingKey="genre_6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" slug="bingeworthy" tag="Bingeworthy" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1783171503" duration="3062000" endsAt="1783174565" id="6a3fc3428012c485c066700f" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/><Media beginsAt="1783201464" duration="3063000" endsAt="1783204527" id="6a3fc3428012c485c0667019" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video></MediaContainer>
